{"id": "f137077a04a35be", "title": "海丰县排水防涝（海绵城市）建设项目第八期标段一招标投标活动暂停公告", "sourceUrl": "https://www.gdzwfw.gov.cn/ggzy-portal/#/44/new/jygg/v3/A?noticeId=3f94c165093348648eb551cc5049642c", "date": "2026-07-06", "source": "广东省公共资源交易平台", "content": "各投标人：\n我\n单位实施\n的\n“\n海丰县排水防涝（海绵城市）建设项目第八期标段一\n”，该项目\n于\n202\n6\n年\n6\n月\n17\n日在汕尾市公共资源交易平台\n、广东省招标投标监管网\n发布\n了招标公告。\n现因故暂停该项目的招标投标活动，恢复招标投标活动的时间另行通知，以最新发布招标公告及招标文件为准。由此给各投标人作造成的不便，敬请谅解。\n招\n标\n单\n位\n：\n海丰县住房和城乡建设局\n招标代理机构：广东省壬申工程管理有限公司\n日\n期：\n202\n6\n年\n7\n月\n06\n日", "html": "<div><p style=\";text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:165%\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">各投标人：</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:40px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:165%\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">我</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">单位实施</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">的</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">“</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">海丰县排水防涝（海绵城市）建设项目第八期标段一</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">”，该项目</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">于</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">202</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">6</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">年</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">6</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">月</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">17</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">日在汕尾市公共资源交易平台</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">、广东省招标投标监管网</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">发布</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">了招标公告。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:40px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:165%\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">现因故暂停该项目的招标投标活动，恢复招标投标活动的时间另行通知，以最新发布招标公告及招标文件为准。由此给各投标人作造成的不便，敬请谅解。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:37px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:165%\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:160px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:165%\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">招</span> <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">标</span> <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">单</span> <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">位</span> <span style=\"font-family:宋体\">：</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">海丰县住房和城乡建设局</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:160px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:165%\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">招标代理机构：广东省壬申工程管理有限公司</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:160px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:165%\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:宋体\">期：</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">202</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">6</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">年</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">7</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;line-height:165%;font-size:20px\">月</span><span st